---@field Origin? aws.geo_routes.Position|distilled.Secret The starting point for isoline calculations, specified as [longitude, latitude] coordinates. For example, this could be a store location, service center, or any point from which you want to calculate reachable areas. Either Origin or Destination must be provided.
