---@field LineString? aws.geo_routes.LineString A series of [longitude, latitude] coordinate pairs defining the connection path when Simple geometry format is requested. These coordinates can be directly used as the coordinates array in a GeoJSON LineString without transformation.
---@field Polyline? distilled.Secret An encoded representation of the connection path when FlexiblePolyline geometry format is requested. This provides a more compact representation suitable for transmission and storage. To convert to GeoJSON, first decode to obtain coordinate pairs, then use those coordinates as the coordinates array in a GeoJSON LineString.

---@alias aws.geo_routes.IsolineConnectionList aws.geo_routes.IsolineConnection[]

