---@class aws.geo_routes.OptimizeWaypointsRequest
---@field Avoid? aws.geo_routes.WaypointOptimizationAvoidanceOptions Features that are avoided. Avoidance is on a best-case basis. If an avoidance can't be satisfied for a particular case, this setting is ignored.
---@field Clustering? aws.geo_routes.WaypointOptimizationClusteringOptions Clustering allows you to specify how nearby waypoints can be clustered to improve the optimized sequence.
---@field DepartureTime? aws.geo_routes.TimestampWithTimezoneOffset|distilled.Secret Departure time from the waypoint.
---@field Destination? aws.geo_routes.Position|distilled.Secret The final position for the route in the World Geodetic System (WGS 84) format: [longitude, latitude].
---@field DestinationOptions? aws.geo_routes.WaypointOptimizationDestinationOptions Destination related options.
---@field Driver? aws.geo_routes.WaypointOptimizationDriverOptions Driver related options.
---@field Exclude? aws.geo_routes.WaypointOptimizationExclusionOptions Features to be strictly excluded while calculating the route.
---@field Key? aws.geo_routes.ApiKey|distilled.Secret Optional: The API key to be used for authorization. Either an API key or valid SigV4 signature must be provided when making a request.
---@field OptimizeSequencingFor? aws.geo_routes.WaypointOptimizationSequencingObjective|string Specifies the optimization criteria for the calculated sequence.
---@field Origin aws.geo_routes.Position|distilled.Secret The start position for the route in World Geodetic System (WGS 84) format: [longitude, latitude].
---@field OriginOptions? aws.geo_routes.WaypointOptimizationOriginOptions Origin related options.
---@field Traffic? aws.geo_routes.WaypointOptimizationTrafficOptions Traffic-related options.
---@field TravelMode? aws.geo_routes.WaypointOptimizationTravelMode|string Specifies the mode of transport when calculating a route. Used in estimating the speed of travel and road compatibility.
---@field TravelModeOptions? aws.geo_routes.WaypointOptimizationTravelModeOptions Travel mode related options for the provided travel mode.
---@field Waypoints? aws.geo_routes.WaypointOptimizationWaypointList List of waypoints between the Origin and Destination, in World Geodetic System (WGS 84) format: [longitude, latitude].

---@class aws.geo_routes.OptimizeWaypointsResponse
---@field Connections aws.geo_routes.WaypointOptimizationConnectionList Details about the connection from one waypoint to the next, within the optimized sequence.
---@field Distance distilled.Secret Overall distance to travel the whole sequence.
---@field Duration distilled.Secret Overall duration to travel the whole sequence.
---@field ImpedingWaypoints aws.geo_routes.WaypointOptimizationImpedingWaypointList Returns waypoints that caused the optimization problem to fail, and the constraints that were unsatisfied leading to the failure.
---@field OptimizedWaypoints aws.geo_routes.WaypointOptimizationOptimizedWaypointList Waypoints in the order of the optimized sequence.
---@field PricingBucket string The pricing bucket for which the query is charged at.
---@field TimeBreakdown aws.geo_routes.WaypointOptimizationTimeBreakdown Time breakdown for the sequence.

