---@field CarShuttleTrains? aws.geo_routes.SensitiveBoolean|distilled.Secret Avoid car-shuttle-trains while calculating the route. Not supported in ap-southeast-1 and ap-southeast-5 regions for GrabMaps customers.
---@field ControlledAccessHighways? aws.geo_routes.SensitiveBoolean|distilled.Secret Avoid controlled access highways while calculating the route.
---@field DirtRoads? aws.geo_routes.SensitiveBoolean|distilled.Secret Avoid dirt roads while calculating the route. Not supported in ap-southeast-1 and ap-southeast-5 regions for GrabMaps customers.
---@field Ferries? aws.geo_routes.SensitiveBoolean|distilled.Secret Avoid ferries while calculating the route.
---@field SeasonalClosure? aws.geo_routes.SensitiveBoolean|distilled.Secret Avoid roads that have seasonal closure while calculating the route. Not supported in ap-southeast-1 and ap-southeast-5 regions for GrabMaps customers.
---@field TollRoads? aws.geo_routes.SensitiveBoolean|distilled.Secret Avoids roads where the specified toll transponders are the only mode of payment.
---@field TollTransponders? aws.geo_routes.SensitiveBoolean|distilled.Secret Avoids roads where the specified toll transponders are the only mode of payment. Not supported in ap-southeast-1 and ap-southeast-5 regions for GrabMaps customers.
---@field TruckRoadTypes? aws.geo_routes.TruckRoadTypeList Truck road type identifiers. BK1 through BK4 apply only to Sweden. A2,A4,B2,B4,C,D,ET2,ET4 apply only to Mexico. Not supported in ap-southeast-1 and ap-southeast-5 regions for GrabMaps customers.
---@field Tunnels? aws.geo_routes.SensitiveBoolean|distilled.Secret Avoid tunnels while calculating the route. Not supported in ap-southeast-1 and ap-southeast-5 regions for GrabMaps customers.
---@field UTurns? aws.geo_routes.SensitiveBoolean|distilled.Secret Avoid U-turns for calculation on highways and motorways. Not supported in ap-southeast-1 and ap-southeast-5 regions for GrabMaps customers.
---@field ZoneCategories? aws.geo_routes.RouteAvoidanceZoneCategoryList Zone categories to be avoided. Not supported in ap-southeast-1 and ap-southeast-5 regions for GrabMaps customers.

