---@field Polyline? distilled.Secret An ordered list of positions used to plot a route on a map in a lossy compression format.

---@alias aws.geo_routes.RouteLegList aws.geo_routes.RouteLeg[]

---@alias aws.geo_routes.RouteLegTravelMode "Car"|"Ferry"|"Pedestrian"|"Scooter"|"Truck"|"CarShuttleTrain"|"AerialTramway"|"Airplane"|"Bus"|"BusRapidTransit"|"CityTrain"|"FunicularRailway"|"HighSpeedTrain"|"IntercityTrain"|"InterregionalTrain"|"LightRail"|"Monorail"|"PrivateBus"|"RegionalTrain"|"Subway"

