---@field Distance distilled.Secret The total distance of travel for the route.
---@field Duration distilled.Secret The expected duration of travel for the route.
---@field Error? aws.geo_routes.RouteMatrixErrorCode Error code that occurred during calculation of the route.

---@alias aws.geo_routes.RouteMatrixErrorCode "NoMatch"|"NoMatchDestination"|"NoMatchOrigin"|"NoRoute"|"OutOfBounds"|"OutOfBoundsDestination"|"OutOfBoundsOrigin"|"Other"|"Violation"

---Specifies strict exclusion options for the route calculation. This setting mandates that the router will avoid any routes that include the specified options, rather than merely attempting to minimize them.
---@class aws.geo_routes.RouteMatrixExclusionOptions
---@field Countries aws.geo_routes.CountryCodeList List of countries to be avoided defined by two-letter or three-letter country codes.

---@alias aws.geo_routes.RouteMatrixHazardousCargoType "Combustible"|"Corrosive"|"Explosive"|"Flammable"|"Gas"|"HarmfulToWater"|"Organic"|"Other"|"Poison"|"PoisonousInhalation"|"Radioactive"

---@alias aws.geo_routes.RouteMatrixHazardousCargoTypeList (aws.geo_routes.RouteMatrixHazardousCargoType|string)[]

---Matching options.
---@class aws.geo_routes.RouteMatrixMatchingOptions
---@field NameHint? aws.geo_routes.SensitiveString|distilled.Secret Attempts to match the provided position to a road similar to the provided name.
---@field OnRoadThreshold? aws.geo_routes.DistanceMeters|distilled.Secret If the distance to a highway/bridge/tunnel/sliproad is within threshold, the waypoint will be snapped to the highway/bridge/tunnel/sliproad.
---@field Radius? aws.geo_routes.DistanceMeters|distilled.Secret Considers all roads within the provided radius to match the provided destination to. The roads that are considered are determined by the provided Strategy.
---@field Strategy? aws.geo_routes.MatchingStrategy|string Strategy that defines matching of the position onto the road network. MatchAny considers all roads possible, whereas MatchMostSignificantRoad matches to the most significant road.

---The start position for the route in World Geodetic System (WGS 84) format: [longitude, latitude].
---@class aws.geo_routes.RouteMatrixOrigin
