---@field Position aws.geo_routes.Position|distilled.Secret Position in World Geodetic System (WGS 84) format: [longitude, latitude].

---@alias aws.geo_routes.RouteMatrixOriginList aws.geo_routes.RouteMatrixOrigin[]

---Origin related options.
---@class aws.geo_routes.RouteMatrixOriginOptions
---@field AvoidActionsForDistance? aws.geo_routes.DistanceMeters|distilled.Secret Avoids actions for the provided distance. This is typically to consider for users in moving vehicles who may not have sufficient time to make an action at an origin or a destination.
---@field Heading? aws.geo_routes.Heading|distilled.Secret GPS Heading at the position.
---@field Matching? aws.geo_routes.RouteMatrixMatchingOptions Options to configure matching the provided position to the road network.
---@field SideOfStreet? aws.geo_routes.RouteMatrixSideOfStreetOptions Options to configure matching the provided position to a side of the street.

