---Traffic related options.
---@class aws.geo_routes.RouteMatrixTrafficOptions
---@field FlowEventThresholdOverride? aws.geo_routes.DurationSeconds|distilled.Secret Duration for which flow traffic is considered valid. For this period, the flow traffic is used over historical traffic data. Flow traffic refers to congestion, which changes very quickly. Duration in seconds for which flow traffic event would be considered valid. While flow traffic event is valid it will be used over the historical traffic data.
---@field Usage? aws.geo_routes.TrafficUsage|string Determines if traffic should be used or ignored while calculating the route.

